        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam shadowing false\n\nactor \&quot;Khách hàng\&quot; as Customer\nactor \&quot;Nhân viên / Admin\&quot; as Staff\n\nactor \&quot;Hệ thống Quản lý Sản phẩm\\n(PIM/ERP)\&quot; as ProductSys &lt;&lt; External System &gt;&gt;\nactor \&quot;Dịch vụ Thanh toán Trực tuyến\\n(Gateway)\&quot; as PaymentGateway &lt;&lt; External System &gt;&gt;\nactor \&quot;Dịch vụ Email\\n(SMTP / Mail API)\&quot; as EmailService &lt;&lt; External System &gt;&gt;\n\nrectangle \&quot;RANH GIỚI HỆ THỐNG e-SHOPPING\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;UC01: Tìm kiếm &amp; Xem sản phẩm\&quot; as UC01\n    usecase \&quot;UC02: Quản lý giỏ hàng\&quot; as UC02\n    usecase \&quot;UC03: Đặt hàng\&quot; as UC03\n    usecase \&quot;UC04: Kiểm tra tồn kho\&quot; as UC04\n    usecase \&quot;UC05: Thanh toán trực tuyến\&quot; as UC05\n    usecase \&quot;UC06: Gửi email thông báo\&quot; as UC06\n    usecase \&quot;UC07: Quản lý đơn hàng\&quot; as UC07\n}\n\n&#39; Tương tác Actor con người\nCustomer --&gt; UC01\nCustomer --&gt; UC03\nStaff --&gt; UC07\n\n&#39; Quan hệ Use Case\nUC01 .&gt; UC02 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC02 .&gt; UC03 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC03 .&gt; UC04 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC03 &lt;. UC05 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC05 .&gt; UC06 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC07 .&gt; UC06 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Tương tác External System\nUC01 --&gt; ProductSys\nUC04 --&gt; ProductSys\nUC05 --&gt; PaymentGateway\nUC06 --&gt; EmailService\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="tMQ-QnFuPwYv4T6PA5Kl-13">
